(
    doc = "LED high-bay array, 1.2 x 0.3 m linear fixtures at 9.6 m, on aisle and cross-aisle centrelines (never over a rack run -- the racking would shadow the working plane). ~5000 K. NOTE: Kit's UsdLux intensity is not photometric by default, so these values are tuned for sensor-plausible exposure, not asserted as lumen-accurate. They have NOT been render-verified -- no RTX renderer is available offline."
